OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FThe team's new dermatologist Dr
OL,7,     FMagnus Lynch specialises in facial
OL,8,     Fsurgery and makes an explosive
OL,9,     Fstart with a large jawline cyst.
OL,10,     FPlus, a man with infectious warts.
OL,11,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,12,     FWhen 17-year-old Connor Lyons is
OL,13,     Ffound dead with no obvious
OL,14,     Finjuries and no witnesses,
OL,15,     Fdetectives uncover a disturbing
OL,16,     Ftruth, using microscopic evidence
OL,17,     Fto trace the killer.
